  "body": "Welcome to this beautifully crafted two-storey home where modern elegance meets everyday family comfort. Positioned on a 200sqm (approx.) freehold section with a thoughtfully designed 172sqm (approx.) floor area, this residence offers a lifestyle defined by space, light, and effortless functionality.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover natural light fills the open-plan kitchen and dining area, creating a welcoming central space where everyday life naturally unfolds. The modern kitchen, complete with sleek cabinetry and generous bench space, makes it both functional and inviting for family living. A separate lounge sits alongside, offering a calm and flexible retreat for downtime, entertainment, or hosting friends and family. This area can also be used as an additional bedroom, offering extra flexibility for the home. With easy access to the sunny outdoor deck, the home delivers a seamless connection between indoor comfort and outdoor enjoyment, perfectly suited to today's lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor also features a well-appointed bathroom for added convenience, while the single internal-access garage with an integrated laundry nook ensures daily routines remain simple and organized.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home continues to impress with four generously sized bedrooms, thoughtfully designed to accommodate growing families or guests with ease. The master suite offers a private sanctuary, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and an elegant ensuite - the perfect space to unwind and recharge at the end of the day. The remaining bedrooms are all light-filled and spacious and are serviced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom with a bathtub.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\nIntercom\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly desirable Silverdale community, this home places you moments from everything you need. Enjoy easy walking access to Hibiscus Coast Station, Park & Ride, along with convenient proximity to Pak'nSave Silverdale, Silverdale Mall, KingsWay School, Northern Arena, local cafés, and parks. Excellent motorway connections ensure an effortless commute, while the setting offers the perfect balance of suburban peace and modern convenience-an ideal lifestyle for today's families.\r\n\r\nWhether you are upsizing, investing, or searching for the perfect place to call home, this exceptional property presents an outstanding opportunity in one of Silverdale's most sought-after neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and experience the warmth, style, and comfort this beautiful home has to offer.",
